 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Co6aVv2nGA0Q7kNvwFHoeoE&_nc_oc=AdrWMpqi923v6PBnV9RthlFen3eWkY3lAYpRGa8qg6021K90upmuYqkbEG0sKFAyQPI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRhOjSyLUwW079CtLArZTtZ_F4WBUClN2rmsdefAfYmZA&oe=6AE8A9C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3Ewcb6haV2cQ7kNvwG-JUrb&_nc_oc=Adoy8VfJV0iOVr25xPwjVMJnOvyD2aiXdAxZFoYToImzlKWsxzQfO4bkEcECKS7AzsY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSTFflXK1_oidlgDhSgqnqwrABRWnJDP3cmxjQCHsqXzQ&oe=6AE8B726"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DNjFAMOXTVkQ7kNvwEhUhkl&_nc_oc=AdrTHmslK1nWw5WLJfBCkjogDyI3qGiBiOBE22rhYBxWwOEE4QwBG5S9deph8V7RUeI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR2UZ2l0QozYS5LLESnOtwldVqCeKRhFv_YaudWOr071Q&oe=6AE8C11C"}, {"fil